      "directNodeIds": [
        "cnm_237",
        "cnm_220"
      ],
      "explanation": "An inverse proportional function requires the exponent to be \\(-1\\), so \\(m^2-2=-1\\), giving \\(m=\\pm1\\). Also, \\(m+1\\ne0\\), so \\(m\\ne-1\\). Therefore, \\(m=1\\), in which case \\(y=2/x\\).",
